\s39 \li2520 \fi-604 \f1 \b0 \fs28 \f3 -\f1 \'80(int)\b currentMode\
\fs14\
\b0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns the color picker\'27s current mode (or submode, if applicable). The returned value should be unique to your color picker. See this protocol description\'27s list of the unique values for the standard color pickers used by the Application Kit.\
\fs14\
\pard \s57 \li2804 \fi-1292 \ri1007 \ql \tx2799 \tx3282 \tx3771 \fs28 \f0 \b \fs24 See also:\tab \f1 \b0 \fs28 \f3 -\f1 \'80supportsMode:\
